<page-layout title="隐私设置" back showMainNav selectedTab="2">
  <view class="subpage privacy-page">
    <view class="privacy-intro">◇　我们重视您的隐私与数据安全，您可以在这里管理个人信息与隐私偏好</view>

    <view class="privacy-card ui-card">
      <view class="privacy-card__title"><text>☁</text> 数据与同步</view>
      <view class="privacy-setting privacy-setting--notice">
        <view class="privacy-setting__icon">▱</view>
        <view class="privacy-setting__content"><view>作品自动备份</view><text>已登录后，作品会自动安全备份至当前账号。网络不可用时，作品将暂存本机并在网络恢复后继续同步。</text></view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="privacy-card ui-card privacy-documents">
      <view class="privacy-card__title"><text>◇</text> 隐私与协议</view>
      <view class="privacy-document" data-key="privacy-policy" bindtap="openDocument"><text>▤</text><view>小露拼豆隐私政策</view><text>›</text></view>
      <view class="privacy-document" data-key="personal-information" bindtap="openDocument"><text>▤</text><view>个人信息收集清单</view><text>›</text></view>
      <view class="privacy-document" data-key="third-party-sharing" bindtap="openDocument"><text>▤</text><view>第三方信息共享清单</view><text>›</text></view>
    </view>

    <view class="cancel-account ui-card {{isDeleting ? 'cancel-account--loading' : ''}}" bindtap="cancelAccount"><view class="cancel-account__icon">◯</view><view><view>{{isDeleting ? '正在注销…' : '注销账号'}}</view><text>注销后将无法恢复，请谨慎操作</text></view><text>›</text></view>
    <view class="privacy-safe">♙　您的隐私安全，我们全力守护</view>
  </view>
</page-layout>
